{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116751","id":3324828627,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7GLNvT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116751","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116751.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116751.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116751","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116751/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116751/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116751/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/892381663ba729eba95c0849a7338a61bc15d24b","number":116751,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Presort text draw calls (simplified version). (reverted)","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"| Before | After |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| <img width=\"1042\" height=\"1180\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-25 at 11 47 54\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f34aa040-86a9-40f6-b5f2-48e4087a1dbf\" /> | <img width=\"1042\" height=\"1180\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-25 at 11 47 28\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93b5d9f6-d683-4941-8f36-980b985b275e\" /> |\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107109\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537\r\nAlso fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116771 \r\nSupersede https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108369\r\n\r\nSame as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108369, but with much simpler API (only adding two functions).\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>A quick description of the issue this PR is fixing</summary>\r\n\r\n- we can't predict how glyphs are distributed among textures and used, so batching was constantly breaking.\r\n- font glyphs are designed to overlay and in general draw order does not matter.\r\n\r\nFor example, the following string \"ABCDEFAAEDBF\" might be processed in this way (assuming every texture can hold 4 glyphs, so simplicity, in practice this is only relevant for the text with a lot of distinct characters):\r\n- A → glyph is encountered for the first time and rasterized to texture 1, and drawn\r\n- B → same, and drawn\r\n- C → same, and drawn\r\n- D → same, and drawn\r\n- E → texture 1 is full, glyph is rasterized to texture 2, and drawn (batching breaks since texture is changed)\r\n- F → same, and drawn\r\n\r\n| Texture 1 | Texture 2 |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| ABCD | EF |\r\n\r\n- A → batching breaks\r\n- A\r\n- E → batching breaks\r\n- D → batching breaks\r\n- B\r\n- F → batching breaks\r\n\r\nThis PR rearranges draw commands to ensure batching won't unnecessarily break.\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n// Line 1:\r\nRenderingServer::get_singleton()->canvas_item_set_presort_level(ci, 0);\r\n// draw A outline from texture 1\r\n// draw B outline from texture 2\r\n// draw C outline from texture 1\r\nRenderingServer::get_singleton()->canvas_item_set_presort_level(ci, 1);\r\n// draw A text from texture 3\r\n// draw B text from texture 4\r\n// draw C text from texture 3\r\n\r\n// Line 2:\r\nRenderingServer::get_singleton()->canvas_item_set_presort_level(ci, 0);\r\n// draw D outline from texture 2\r\n// draw C outline from texture 1\r\nRenderingServer::get_singleton()->canvas_item_set_presort_level(ci, 1);\r\n// draw D text from texture 4\r\n// draw C text from texture 3\r\n\r\nRenderingServer::get_singleton()->canvas_item_flush_presort(ci); // rearanges draw commands ignoring original call order.\r\n\r\n// Rearranged as (4 batches instead of 10):\r\n// draw A outline from texture 1\r\n// draw C outline from texture 1\r\n// draw C outline from texture 1\r\n// draw B outline from texture 2\r\n// draw D outline from texture 2\r\n// draw A text from texture 3\r\n// draw C text from texture 3\r\n// draw C text from texture 3\r\n// draw B text from texture 4\r\n// draw D text from texture 4\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-25T09:58:13Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T07:33:58Z","closed_at":"2026-06-22T13:34:29Z","merged_at":"2026-06-22T13:34:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"41e336445594dd663e80b4272cda703109ce4ffa","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/fo